{"sectionId":"electro/cells","items":[{"id":"electro--cells-k001","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"전기화학에서 anode는 산화, cathode는 환원이 일어나는 전극이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k002","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"갈바니 전지는 자발 반응으로 전기에너지를 공급하고 전해전지는 외부 전원을 이용해 비자발 반응을 구동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k003","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"갈바니 전지의 anode는 음극, cathode는 양극이고 전해전지에서는 극성이 반대다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k004","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"전자는 외부 회로에서 anode→cathode로 이동한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k005","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"염다리는 이온 이동으로 전기적 중성을 유지한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k006","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"표준 환원전위로 E°cell=E°cathode−E°anode를 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k007","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"ΔG°=−nFE°이며 E=E°−RT/(nF)lnQ, 25℃에서 E=E°−0.05916/n logQ이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k008","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"평형에서 E=0, lnK=nFE°/RT이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k009","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"전기분해에서 Q전하=It, 전자 몰수=It/F, 생성물 양은 반쪽반응 계수로 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k010","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"농도전지는 농도 차이에 의해 전위가 발생하고 농도 평형에 접근하면서 전위가 감소한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k011","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"F≈96485 C/mol e⁻.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k012","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"전극전위는 반응 계수를 곱해도 곱하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k013","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"자발 갈바니 반응은 E>0, ΔG<0.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k014","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"염다리 음이온은 보통 산화전극 쪽 양전하 증가를 보상한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--cells-k015","sectionId":"electro/cells","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"0.050 mol이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}